== mini-troff -T md sample.md: written back; and that read and written again, the same
\title{sample}{7}{typesetting}

# NAME
sample – the new format, each thing of it once

# DESCRIPTION
A paragraph is lines to a blank one, *italic*, *italic again*,
**bold**, `typed`, a link's words and *n log n*, by
**ix**.\up{\small{\small{1}}} A snake_case name, a price of \$5 and
\$10, 2 \* 3, an escaped \*star\*, a name not known: \\n, and one with
a text: kept. See *More*, Figure 1 and *rc*(1).\
A line ended by a backslash. \small{Small}, \big{big}, x\up{2}.
\footnote{
\1. A footnote, said where it is.
}

